WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.779
A ticket to Cologne, please.

00:00:03.029 --> 00:00:05.636
One way or return?

00:00:05.886 --> 00:00:08.274
One way, for tomorrow morning.

00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:12.024
The train leaves at nine from platform three.

00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:15.417
At nine, platform three. Thank you.
